301435", "personaname": "Tbolinger76", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/tbolinger76/", "num_games_owned": 2656, "num_reviews": 908, "playtime_forever": 18, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 18, "last_played": 1746156979, "avatar": "b4324c7a10b266ccf92d8f428703aee4cae54801"}, "language": "english", "review": "Legit not even sure how this one ended up in my library, but here I am 20mins later. \nSo, that was terrible. Story wasn't even there, just kind of throws you in without warning and you start fighting. \nNot sure why it asked for me to pick my \"favorite character\" and \"second favorite character\" when even playing with 3 AIs, it still didn't give me either one.\nThe combat is overly simplistic and kind of janky.\nThe graphics seem like something I'd expect from the 360 era.\nOh, and to boot, let's not forget the unnecessary alphabet soup pandering. 3 normal banners and twice as many lgbtqmnop ones.\nWould love a refund, but literally don't even know how I got this. 3/10", "timestamp_created": 1746157251, "timestamp_updated": 1746157251, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.459770888090133667", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}]}